%% Volunteer High-Level Sequence Diagram-Apply for Events
sequenceDiagram
    actor Volunteer
    participant System as Event Management System

    Volunteer->>System: Browse available events
    System-->>Volunteer: Display available events
    Volunteer->>System: Select an event and submit application
    System->>System: Validate application and event availability
    alt Application is valid and event is available
        System-->>Volunteer: Confirm application submission (Pending)
    else Application cannot be submitted
        System-->>Volunteer: Display rejection message
    end
